{"id":1711,"level":70,"name":"На рекорд: збереження загрози","group":"Чемпіон тактичного міксу","format":29,"description":"<p>How many puzzles can you solve without making mistakes? Get stars and improve your record.</p>  <p>This&nbsp;Record-breaker&nbsp;is all about maintaining threats.&nbsp;In every puzzle, you have a nice threat on the chessboard but there is also a problem. You have to&nbsp;come up with a smart move to solve that problem, so that you can take a piece in your next move.</p>  <p><span style='color: #004b90;'>Use these steps:</span></p>  <ol>  <li><span style='color: #004b90;'>Find the piece you can capture (your threat);</span></li>  <li><span style='color: #004b90;'>Find the threat of the opponent (capturing, checkmate);</span></li>  <li><span style='color: #004b90;'>Figure out&nbsp;a clever solution that will&nbsp;save your piece or prevent checkmate and will also maintain&nbsp;your own threat. Think of all the tricks you have learned before;</span></li>  <li><span style='color: #004b90;'>Capture the enemy piece.</span></li>  </ol>  <p></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":48,"examples":[],"puzzles":[{"id":73813,"fen":"4q3/3r1p1k/6pp/2R1Q3/8/1n3BPP/5PK1/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,3,-185,-182,-173,-186]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1... Re7 ! {[%csl Re5][%cal Gb3c5, Ge5e8]} (1... Qxe5? 2. Rxe5) (1... Nxc5? 2. Qxe8) 2. Qd6 Nxc5 *","format":29,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":73855,"fen":"r4rk1/1pp1bppp/2n5/3qp3/p1N5/PQ1P2P1/1P2PPBP/2RR2K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,3,-277,-279,-267,-264]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1... Qxg2+ ! {[%csl Yd5][%cal Gg2d5, Ga4b3]} (1... axb3? 2. Bxd5) 2. Kxg2 axb3 *","format":29,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":73807,"fen":"4n3/1r3p1k/6pp/3p4/1BbP2BP/8/5PPK/4R3 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,3,-300,-310,-376,-393]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1... Nf6 ! {[%csl Rg4][%cal Ge1e8, Gb7b4]} (1... Rxb4? 2. Rxe8) 2. Bf3 Rxb4 *","format":29,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":73824,"fen":"5bk1/5pp1/1pn4p/2p5/Pq5